mplete the look with matching red high heels, and set her expression to a cool rebellious gaze directed straight into the camera lens. Build her figure head-to-toe at a natural adult head-to-body ratio of one to seven so the complete body from crown to heels reads correctly proportioned within the doorway, captured from a low-angle wide-lens perspective that elongates her legs while keeping the anatomy realistic. Pose her standing head-to-toe inside the frame at the shop entrance with both arms extended straight toward the lens in a precise C-BLOCK gesture: the left hand sits higher with palm inward, its index and middle fingers held together pointing upward and its thumb extended sideways, while the right hand sits lower with palm inward, its index and middle fingers held together pointing downward and its thumb extended sideways crossing beside the left thumb, every finger staying straight, natural and clearly readable under the retained flash exposure, her face remaining fully visible between and above the two hands. The shop entrance surrounds her with worn storefront textures of a weathered plaster wall, painted wooden door frames and a low concrete step, crowned by vintage Chinese signage: a vertical dark-green board beside the doorway bears the faded gold traditional characters \"歡迎光臨\" stacked from top to bottom, and a red enamel sign mounted above the entrance carries the bold white brush-style type \"美味小吃\" set in one horizontal row; inside the shop behind her, a warm incandescent glow pools over wooden shelves and spills forward onto her silhouette. Light the scene by contrasting the cool-toned direct flash illumination on her skin with the warm storefront glow of the background, letting her red heels plant firmly on the concrete step with a crisp contact shadow beneath them, balancing nostalgic warmth against modern rebellious energy within one coherent early-2000s film snapshot mood."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label"